{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/712749423ffd9002ea98bce090b816d2.poster.avif?t=1762593990\" width=992 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/712749423ffd9002ea98bce090b816d2.webm?t=1762593990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/712749423ffd9002ea98bce090b816d2.mp4?t=1762593990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi master !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm NEKO - your tiny typing buddy - a super fast keyboard companion !!! \u0d26\u0d4d\u0d26\u0d3f/\u1420\uff61\u2038\uff61\u141f\\</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you type, I type along, working hard like a little cat in training. I don't just type for fun, I'm here to bring a bit of cuteness and energy to your workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep typing, and together we'll create every line, every idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your keystroke are the beat of my heart, \u2665 \u2665 \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0e05^&gt;\u2a4a&lt;^ \u0e05</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an interactive keyboard simulation and decoration game. Your little cat Neko loves playing with the mechanical keyboard and small decorative items. Help Neko customize the keyboard and arrange the decorations around him in the most beautiful way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.poster.avif?t=1762593990\" width=762 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.webm?t=1762593990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.mp4?t=1762593990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Ctrl + Shift + E to open Setting UI</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the keyboard, including its shape, color, and size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the sound of each key press on the keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and arrange the decorative items around it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a representative character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you press any key, Neko will gain experience points to level up, unlocking new decorative items and features.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078150?t=1762593990","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/2fb8b5ceed4de245a4b7be3638b70e8c3b625cf6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762593990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/1aa0fdb71dde35b98c4f8f450fac712012106201/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762593990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/1aa0fdb71dde35b98c4f8f450fac712012106201/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762593990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"